  "body": "Wendy Adams deck only. Advanced.\n【Revelation】 - Put Abandoned and Alone into play in your threat area, with 3 horror on it. It cannot leave play while it has 1 or more horror on it.\n【Forced】 - After you trigger Wendy Adams's ⭕ ability: Move 1 horror from Abandoned and Alone to Wendy Adams. Then, if Abandoned and Alone has no horror on it, discard it.",
